{"unit_id":"chenwei2000007__dsh-peak-light#feature-1","repo":"chenwei2000007/dsh-peak-light","commit":"f680305021aa8f641f64e0fb7b23e01adac4fe38","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peak-light 的「峰谷时段指示」：在 DSH 侧栏品牌旁显示红色峰时或绿色谷时圆点。插件按北京时间工作日时段和 2026 节假日判断当前状态，自动定时刷新。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/ui.js:77-104","src/ui.js:107-121","src/policy.js:96-115"]}
